  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "三峽"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjukuktY4DL-JOXbuSJ3VkW_R7zV2txFAtnOMnL6XbaLpBAMshvQCDSeOgSQavT1IABHlw0zqvKcpyo_y1SFHNmVhISxzfy41j1cixdxBw2yIwDg_86XZFGedu7y0BOqQ-xgR_y5u0q0PnRW5ldmuSNTEsRxS5lWzXfXxROp22JF7LObKUYgjCyNoxi-Blo/s2048/%E9%95%B7%E7%A6%8F%E6%A9%8B.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1153\" data-original-width=\"2048\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjukuktY4DL-JOXbuSJ3VkW_R7zV2txFAtnOMnL6XbaLpBAMshvQCDSeOgSQavT1IABHlw0zqvKcpyo_y1SFHNmVhISxzfy41j1cixdxBw2yIwDg_86XZFGedu7y0BOqQ-xgR_y5u0q0PnRW5ldmuSNTEsRxS5lWzXfXxROp22JF7LObKUYgjCyNoxi-Blo/w640-h360/%E9%95%B7%E7%A6%8F%E6%A9%8B.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></span></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b><br /></b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>江芃芸&nbsp;</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">日頭ê光線tshiō tī紅磚仔頂</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">長長ê走廊看入眼內</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">終其尾</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">是百姓ê ǹg望</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">——祖師爺庇佑</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">經過走廊行ǹg前</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">He是鑽tuì鼻空ê牛奶芳</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">牛角pháng　三峽ê特色</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">勻勻仔</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">囡仔時ê甜蜜記憶</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tuè leh慢慢仔浮現--出-來</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">透心涼ê阿忠芋冰</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">黃色、紫色、紅色</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">王梨、芋仔、紅豆</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">熱天獨一無二ê好滋味</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">過晝ê鐘聲響起</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">看日頭落山</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">沓沓仔　沓沓仔</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無偌久ê時間</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">規个天頂就hōo伊染kah紅紅紅</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">日頭落山ê影　留tī水清koh淺ê三峽河</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">南來北往ê人　lóng已經tńg厝--ah</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">只賰poh岸邊ê暗光鳥</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">孤單守護tse美麗ê夜景</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">月娘--啊　月娘</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">請你m̄-thang悲傷</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陪你行過風風雨雨ê長福橋</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雖然無法度koh hām你做伴</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄-koh阮hām lín ê共同回憶</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">猶原清清楚楚</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">活tī每一个三峽人ê心中</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">作者註：三峽清水祖師廟前ê長福橋有30外年ê歷史，長福橋自2月25起封閉舊橋拆除改建。</div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">（作者是安溪國中八年仔ê學生）</div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><a name='more'></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEglnMau2qijAnkGo3kM_WEKsrT1o-r4J6NsPNYCiGlooyXeNYC-dIR6f5BjxHc5RlIZRi-R46k70AWF0w6EUXjdWKAyz8uf52gdvjPGq-MfUTDOOLohelr3w9FmtqfQaoRVCUDQI38kggh7o_E8N_McshT7p2izsC7cwnHSIXoJwBFwH4SlS1MxXaD3LXZn/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1364%E6%9C%9F_4.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEglnMau2qijAnkGo3kM_WEKsrT1o-r4J6NsPNYCiGlooyXeNYC-dIR6f5BjxHc5RlIZRi-R46k70AWF0w6EUXjdWKAyz8uf52gdvjPGq-MfUTDOOLohelr3w9FmtqfQaoRVCUDQI38kggh7o_E8N_McshT7p2izsC7cwnHSIXoJwBFwH4SlS1MxXaD3LXZn/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1364%E6%9C%9F_4.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhsf1C8AxcViI33baYqYE9-duHiaJ4etMrxpIoh1SPcDPRmBRnFrMA4ZBDWHfA7Im9MR8yMjYayG2oLAwbIL-WOr_tKjYVJ-ezF1YbAGmcplqncQBh8fBzbVyWzCafMOiZKt9c-2j-nQP4f3wq610s86bmcPnWPvua8B8_dFHiPAKEx1_mftm8ObyHQO149/s1424/364%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhsf1C8AxcViI33baYqYE9-duHiaJ4etMrxpIoh1SPcDPRmBRnFrMA4ZBDWHfA7Im9MR8yMjYayG2oLAwbIL-WOr_tKjYVJ-ezF1YbAGmcplqncQBh8fBzbVyWzCafMOiZKt9c-2j-nQP4f3wq610s86bmcPnWPvua8B8_dFHiPAKEx1_mftm8ObyHQO149/w450-h640/364%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>#做伙來唸詩 專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap台羅。</b><br /><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPA